  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">She Exports: female entrepreneurship training &amp; event</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For this project, 20 female Ukrainian entrepreneurs are selected and trained to make them more export-ready, innovative and sustainable.The selected entrepreneurs will receive three training sessions focused on the skills needed as a female entrepreneur in the global economy:1.	Business plan development: how to develop a sustainable business plan that fits global standards using the business model canvas methodology and lean validation? (a two-day training)2.	Innovative entrepreneurship: how to be innovative and keep track of global trends? (a two-day training)3.	Entrepreneurship soft skills like, among others, communication, management and pitching. (a two-day training)Finally, the 20 participants who completed the training successfully will participate in a women&apos;s business event in Kyiv where they can pitch their ideas to the business community. During these events, female entrepreneurs are introduced to potential partners and investors and awareness regarding female entrepreneurship in Ukraine is raised.</narrative>
  </description>
